  <-- Worth knowing for the next test: the DUT writes a log line for every address it
      INSTALLS, and no log line at all when an address is REMOVED.  The deletion above is
      the most visible change of this whole case on the wire, and it left nothing in the
      device log.  A test that looked for the deletion in the log would find nothing and
      could wrongly decide it had not happened.

